  "notes": "Hud: no motif, figure or drop. Geometric for «اعبدوا الله ما لكم من إله غيره», a rain cloud for «يرسل السماء عليكم مدرارا», a mountain for «ويزدكم قوة إلى قوتكم». No hands on «استغفروا ربكم». As-Sa'di's «بالتوبة النصوح» is cut (echo of 66:8). STAGING v4: Hud is a blue drop labelled Hud (no plate on his name); 'Ad are three faceless men in dark robes in a desert land (As-Sa'di: al-Ahqaf, in the land of Yemen; no other detail is drawn). All of 50-52 is Hud's speech: he speaks at each call (50:5, 51:1, 52:1), the camera stays wide through his words (no close-up or pan) and his people make no gesture. Geometric for worship Allah, you have no god but Him (50:7-13); nothing drawn on the negated wage (51:2-5). c2 (52): nobody raises hands (the command is addressed to them, not shown done); the promised rain and strength stay symbols on plates (a rain cloud 52:7-10, a mountain for strength 52:11-14), no rain event, since they are conditional on their repenting. The idols are never drawn. No punishment in this video."
